OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors vote to buy town
OL,4,Acentre for #13m
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have voted to buy parts of
OL,7,Fa "run down" town centre for #13m.
OL,9,FMembers of Stockton Council approved a
OL,10,Fplan to buy areas of Billingham from
OL,11,Fprivate owner Sheet Anchor Evolve
OL,12,F(SAE), with a view to revamping the
OL,13,Ftown centre including demolishing the
OL,14,Fvacant Queensway South building and the
OL,15,Fformer library.
OL,17,FCouncillor Paul Rowling said there were
OL,18,Frisks and opportunities with the
OL,19,Fproject, but an overarching concern was
OL,20,Fthat without "taking back control"
OL,21,Fnothing would change. SAE declined to
OL,22,Fcomment at this stage.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
