OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors vote to buy town
OL,4,Acentre for #13m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council valued the land and
OL,7,Fbuildings at #10.75m, but it was felt
OL,8,Fmeeting the asking price of #13m would
OL,9,Fallow work to move forward.
